# Sami, Ship's Engineer {2}{R}{W} 2/4: "At the beginning of your end step, if you control two or more tapped creatures, create a tapped 2/2 colorless Robot artifact creature token" (CR 603.4, 111.1).
# Bot1 casts Sami and a Memnite on turn one. On turn three they attack (two tapped creatures, Sami itself one: the lower bound) and at the end step Bot1 gets a Robot, 2/2 colorless
# and tapped. On turn four Bot2 attacks with its two Memnites, which stay tapped through turn five, when only Bot1's Memnite attacks and the Robot and Sami stay home (one tapped
# creature of its own, just under the bound; the opponent's two tapped creatures do not count): no second Robot.

[Bot1 Deck]
Memnite
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Sami, Ship's Engineer
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Memnite
Island x20

